{"pin":"BH01334","subcodes":[{"code":"BH01334","anchor":"","first_line":"Praise and glorification beseemeth the One True Object of all desire, Who through a single exalted Word hath called all things into being from utter nothingness [3.5s]... ...My God, independent of all things, most generous and merciful, my Sovereign supreme! All are Thy servants","first_line_orig":"حمد و ثنا مقصود یکتا را لایق و سزاست که بیک کلمه علیا اشیا را از عدم بحت  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"640","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15703.085","source":"BLIB_Or15703","locator":"085"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA30:094x","source":"INBA30","locator":"094x","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v030/?page=51"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA65:047x","source":"INBA65","locator":"047x","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v065/?page=49"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA81:009","source":"INBA81","locator":"009","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v081/?page=12"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH1.022x","source":"ADH1","locator":"022x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_1.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AHM.341x","source":"AHM","locator":"341x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AHM/ahm-341.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQMJ1.157x","source":"AQMJ1","locator":"157x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MMQ1/mmq1-159.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BCH.141","source":"BCH","locator":"141","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2021/02/bch.pdf#page=138"},{"kind":"publication","code":"DWNP_v5#12 p.001-002x","source":"DWNP_v5","locator":"12 p.001-002x","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/the-dawn-vol-5-burma-1927"},{"kind":"translation","code":"ADMS#144x","source":"ADMS","locator":"144x","url":"https://adibmasumian.com/translations/bh01334/"}]},{"code":"BH01334WAT","anchor":"wat","translations":[{"language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}]}]}
